      "jcr:created": "Wed Jun 10 2026 18:12:54 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Is your facility prepared to help protect you and other staff?</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/surgical-technologies/products/neptune-s.html\">Begin your Journey to Zero* harm today at Neptune S.</a></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
